<BaseLayout title="About — PastVision" description="About PastVision: engineering, experimentation and independent creation.">
  <section class="page-intro section-wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE BUILDS / 04</p>
    <h1>About<span class="text-accent">.</span></h1>
    <p class="page-lede">A personal space for engineering, curiosity and making things work.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section-wrap about-layout">
    <div class="about-main">
      <p class="eyebrow">HELLO, I'M ANURAG.</p>
      <h2>I like understanding how things work — and then seeing what else they can do.</h2>
      <p>My interests sit somewhere between software engineering and hands-on experimentation. I enjoy building tools, exploring systems, working close to the hardware and learning by making things.</p>
      <p>PastVision is where those interests come together. It is part portfolio, part workshop notebook and part independent identity — a place for finished work as well as experiments that are still finding their shape.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="about-aside">
      <div class="aside-block"><span class="eyebrow">INTERESTS</span><p>Systems · Emulation · Linux · Reverse engineering · Fabrication · Creative software</p></div>
      <div class="aside-block"><span class="eyebrow">ELSEWHERE</span><p><a href="https://github.com/PastVision" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub / PastVision ↗</a></p></div>
    </aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
